# Spices: Garam Masala

Loosely adapted from [https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/…](https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/142967/easy-garam-masala) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251012170515/https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/142967/easy-garam-masala))

{ rating="4" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1.5 tsp [ground cumin]{ ing="ground-cumin" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [ground cardamom]{ ing="ground-cardamom" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [ground coriander]{ ing="ground-coriander" }
- [ ] 3/4 tsp [ground black pepper]{ ing="ground-black-pepper" }
- [ ] 3/4 tsp [turmeric]{ ing="turmeric" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [ground cinnamon]{ ing="ground-cinnamon" }
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [ground cloves]{ ing="ground-cloves" }
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [ground nutmeg]{ ing="ground-nutmeg" }

## Notes

- Makes 2 Tbsp
